# RULES: UI

## Role

Define interface, component, and interaction norms.

## What to fill in during synthesis

- the project's design-system standard components;
- typography, spacing, and colors (raw-value prohibitions, when present);
- visible strings (i18n/hardcoded);
- standard dialogs/overlays;
- loading/empty/error/permission states;
- accessibility and input behavior.

## Typical triggers

- any change to a screen, component, layout, or interaction.
